{"id":"n87608-2-7","stage":5,"title":"후진 · 后退","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87608-2-7-1","ko":"후진 주차 못해?","zh":"不会倒车停车吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"후진","meaning":"后退，倒退，倒","explanation":"후진：后退，倒退，倒。","readings":[{"term":"후진","audio":"/audio/0c0fa45a68e87ddd8451.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87608","senseId":"2","lemma":"후진","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"후진","audio":"/audio/0c0fa45a68e87ddd8451.mp3"}},{"text":"주차","meaning":"停车，停放车辆","explanation":"주차：停车，停放车辆。","readings":[{"term":"주차","audio":"/audio/402473b26294876f2ebe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25986","senseId":"1","lemma":"주차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주차","audio":"/audio/402473b26294876f2ebe.mp3"}},{"text":"못해?","meaning":"不会","explanation":"못하다：不会；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"못하다","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91168","senseId":"1","lemma":"못하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못해","audio":"/audio/70b07f24bea552d391a8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"0c0fa45a68e87ddd","term":"후진","zh":"后退，倒退，倒","audio":"/audio/0c0fa45a68e87ddd8451.mp3","entryId":"87608","definition":"向后方移动。","pronunciation":["후ː진"]},{"id":"402473b26294876f","term":"주차","zh":"停车，停放车辆","audio":"/audio/402473b26294876f2ebe.mp3","entryId":"25986","definition":"把汽车等停在一定的地方。","pronunciation":["주ː차"]},{"id":"641e1150cc79b5b2","term":"못하다","zh":"不会","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3","entryId":"91168","definition":"做某事做不到一定水准或没有做此事的能力。","pronunciation":["모ː타다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d53e598ac11ad5265261.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n87608-2-7-2","ko":"응. 난 그래서 항상 전진해서 주차해.","zh":"嗯。所以我总是选择往前开进去停车。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"